      <span class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-linear-to-r from-navy via-navy/90 to-navy/35 max-md:to-navy/70" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <h2 class="text-[2.8rem] leading-[0.95] sm:text-6xl sm:leading-[0.9]"><span class="block">Trouvons votre fuite.</span><span class="block text-green">En 20 minutes.</span></h2>
